/-!
# Complete finite PSD family for the order120 high collision face

Every matrix is 15-dimensional over the full complex coefficient space.
Twenty new primitive witnesses and two shared order120 low-face endpoints
supply all 30 degree (4,2) Bernstein coefficient occurrences. Their literal rational
LDL identities and phase relations are checked by ordinary kernel reduction.

The actual reduced source polynomial and its coefficient incidence are
separate from these finite positivity proofs. No physical source identity,
external reader status or matrix positivity is assumed here.
-/

